<title>CHINA: Hanil Bank sets $100 mln FRN, 3-mos put.</title>
<headline>Hanil Bank sets $100 mln FRN, 3-mos put.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by arranger Lehman Brothers Asia</p>
<p>BORROWER HANIL BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$100 MLN  COUPON     3ML+20 BP  MATURITY  AUG 2000</p>
<p> TYPE     FRN	   ISS PRICE  99.975     RE-OFFER  99.975</p>
<p> PUTS     YES**	 CALLS	NO	   LAUNCH    01.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING  NO	    REPAYMENT  BULLET     REPLIES   NA</p>
<p> RATING   A-/A3	 SALES LMTS US/KOREA   DENOMS    US$100K</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	   CRS DEF    YES	  FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW  NA	    HOME CTRY  S.KOREA    PAY DATE  07.AUG.97</p>
<p> FEES     5 BP	  MGT/UND    2.5 BP     SELLING   2.5 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGERS LEHMAN BROTHERS ASIA</p>
<p>NOTES  *COUPON STEPS UP TO 3ML+45 BASIS POINTS IF THE ISSUE</p>
<p>	  IS NOT PUT BACK TO BORROWER</p>
<p>	  **ISSUE CAN BE PUT ON NOVEMBER 7, 1997</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6321</p>
</text>
